<section class="llu-section" id="guarantee">
  <div class="llu-wrap">
    <div class="llu-grid llu-grid--split-even">
      <div class="llu-card">
        <p class="llu-eyebrow">The guarantee</p>
        <h2 class="llu-h2 llu-mt-16">Seven days to change your mind.</h2>
        <div class="llu-stack llu-mt-24">
          <p class="llu-lead">Join. Look around. Decide if it's right for you.</p>
          <p>
            If it isn't, email me at izzy@joinclearcareer.com within 7 days of joining. I'll refund every dollar.
          </p>
          <p>
            <span class="llu-strong">One condition.</span> The guarantee ends once we start your resume and LinkedIn
            rebuild. That's 1:1 work, and I can't take it back.
          </p>
          <p>If it doesn't work for you, I don't want to keep your money.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="llu-eyebrow">Who this is not for</p>
        <h2 class="llu-h3 llu-mt-16">Skip this one if any of these are you.</h2>
        <ul class="llu-list llu-list--no llu-mt-24">
          <li>You want someone to run your search for you. We do this together.</li>
          <li>You'd rather go solo, at your own pace. The group is the point.</li>
          <li>You can't give your search a few focused hours a week right now.</li>
          <li>You want a guaranteed job. No one can promise that, and I won't.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="llu-mt-24">
          If that's you, no hard feelings. The right room at the wrong time isn't the right room.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
